822
01:13:30,804 --> 01:13:47,864
これでさ、このゲームってさ第3者視点でで見れるじゃろ？第3者視点で冷静に見た上でこれじゃから、自分が実際にその場にいて考えながらやるってのはなかなか、なかなか難しいのでは。いや実生活弱いね、わしあんまり上手じゃないんだよな声の。
And you see, this game can be viewed from a third-person perspective, right? Since you're looking at it calmly from a third-person perspective and getting this result, actually being there in person and thinking while doing it is quite... quite difficult, isn't it? Yeah, real life is weak for me, I'm not very good at vocal...

823
01:13:51,804 --> 01:14:01,864
