Can you do your best, master? Can you do your best? Can't you do your best? Is it a bit difficult? Can you read the room in the comment section? Is it difficult for you, master?

827
01:14:27,804 --> 01:14:37,864
お、いけるか？いけ、いけないか？しょがいないね。しょがいないよね。そういう時もあるよね。頑張った。頭絵柄がする。
